*> vybe-test: cobol/level_numbers/test_level_88_set_to_true
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_numbers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 0.
   88 IS-ON VALUE 1.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    SET IS-ON TO TRUE.
    DISPLAY WS-FLAG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-FLAG DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

